OL,3,GNEWSANew island to be removed after bus
OL,4,A'shambles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA newly-installed pedestrian island is
OL,7,Fto be removed after it left a road in a
OL,8,Fvillage in Leicestershire too narrow
OL,9,Ffor buses to get through.
OL,11,FArriva Midlands has withdrawn its
OL,12,Fservices from the centre of
OL,13,FQueniborough because it said its
OL,14,Fdrivers were unable to get along
OL,15,FRearsby Road without mounting the
OL,16,Fpavement.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36402
