OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1791613571
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANew island to be removed after bus
OL,4,A'shambles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe island was installed as part of
OL,7,Fwork to upgrade a nearby junction,
OL,8,Fwhich was completed on Saturday 3
OL,9,FOctober, but has not left enough space
OL,10,Fin the road for larger vehicles to get
OL,11,Fround it.
OL,13,FLeicestershire County Council said the
OL,14,Fjunction work had been carried out by
OL,15,Fcontractors for developer David Wilson
OL,16,FHomes but the design had "not proved
OL,17,Fcorrect".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
